0.05    = Verlet distance for optimization
linear  = contact law (linear or hertz)
0       = RenderVideo: write XDMF frames if 1
1.0e4   = Kn: normal stiffness
1.0e4   = Kt: tangential stiffness
0.1     = Gn: normal dissipative coefficient
0.0     = Gt: tangential dissipative coefficient
0.2     = Mu: microscopic friction coefficient
0.0     = Beta: rolling stiffness coefficient
0.0     = Eta: plastic moment coefficient
0.3     = Eps: polydispersity of the generated packing
0.05    = R: particle radius
1000    = seed: random seed of the packing
2.0e-5  = dt: time step
2.0e-2  = dtOut: output interval
1.0     = Lx: periodic cell length (x)
1.0     = Ly: periodic cell width (y)
1.0     = Lz: generation box height (z)
2.6     = rho: particle density
1.0     = fraction: fill fraction at generation
0.55    = target_phi: target solid fraction after compression
2.0e-2  = comp_time: duration of the compression phase
1.0e-2  = shear_rate: Lees-Edwards shear rate during the production phase
2.0e-2  = shear_time: duration of the shear phase
affine  = initial_velocity_mode (affine or random)
0.01    = initial_random_velocity_stddev (random mode only)
1.0     = minimum_compressed_height_over_d
